# NOTE: public/og/ is deliberately COMMITTED, not generated at build time.
#
# It was originally gitignored on the assumption that Cloudflare Pages would run
# `npm run deploy` (= og + generate). It runs the default `npm run generate`,
# which skips scripts/generate-og.mjs, so every og:image 404'd in production
# while the local build was fine. Changing the Pages build command needs
# dashboard access we do not have, so the images are versioned instead.
#
# Regenerate with `npm run og` and commit the result whenever an article is
# added, removed, or retitled. CI does not do this for us.
